WEBVTT

00:25:29.583 --> 00:25:32.101
I also figured that sharing
some personal information

00:25:32.125 --> 00:25:34.059
would help with building rapport.

00:25:34.083 --> 00:25:36.309
In one experiment,
randomly assigning people

00:25:36.333 --> 00:25:39.018
to schmooze for a few minutes
before negotiating

00:25:39.042 --> 00:25:41.226
increased their odds of making a deal.

00:25:41.250 --> 00:25:43.226
I also spent a few minutes thinking about

00:25:43.250 --> 00:25:45.559
how I could bring
something of value to Anthony.

00:25:45.583 --> 00:25:48.684
I figured he sometimes
had to deal with unpleasant customers

00:25:48.708 --> 00:25:51.268
and he might get bored
when traffic is slow,

00:25:51.292 --> 00:25:53.726
so I thought I'd try to entertain him.

00:25:53.750 --> 00:25:55.893
Then I invited a little
information exchange

00:25:55.917 --> 00:25:59.476
when I asked how I could make
the free Cinnataco worth his while.

00:25:59.500 --> 00:26:01.726
I ended up offering
to help spread the word